From ad59f7d5ac9a0f6806fa84a30578515644948ca7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adrien Delmas <adrien@adriendelmas.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 10:03:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 131/131] hydra: geompropvalue default for a missing primvar

MaterialX's geompropvalue returns its `default` where the geometry has no
primvar of that name; Cycles' attribute node read 0. The material records
the non-zero defaults of its geompropvalue nodes, and the objects of a
geometry using it carry them as object attributes, which Cycles reads only
where the geometry has no such attribute (K-90).
---
 src/hydra/geometry.inl | 24 +++++++++++-
 src/hydra/material.cpp | 84 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/hydra/material.h   | 15 ++++++++
 3 files changed, 122 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/hydra/geometry.inl b/src/hydra/geometry.inl
index 70e3464b..45bb6af1 100644
